                                                                             <http://example.org/spectrum_caa008-aldehyde-bare> ;
                                              rdfs:label "Vibrational analysis caa008-aldehyde-bare" ;
                                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "geometry+frequency optimization of bare chloroacetaldehyde at wB97X-D/6-31G(d,p)/PCM(water); extracted from the 1st IRC point converged cluster (bond-length analysis: C3=O4 1.213 A confirms intact carbonyl), part of the standalone hydration thermodynamic cycle dG_hyd = G(hydrate) - [G(aldehyde) + G(water)]" .


