                                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "geometry+frequency optimization of bare chloroacetaldehyde hydrate at wB97X-D/6-31G(d,p)/PCM(water); extracted from the last IRC point converged cluster -- bond-length analysis (C3-O4 1.387 A, C3-O7 1.418 A, C3-O8 3.022 A) confirmed which of the two original spectator waters was incorporated into the gem-diol via a proton relay" .


